# Files that live in the repo but must NOT be served from regenorthopb.com.
# robots.txt is Allow: / with no Disallow, so anything deployed is also
# crawlable — the exclusion has to happen at the deploy, not in robots.

# The generator and its content modules. build.py alone is ~250KB of source,
# including internal comments; the site is fully static once built.
*.py

# Internal docs — CLAUDE.md, README.md.
*.md

# EXCEPTION: pricing.md is published on purpose. It is the machine-readable
# price sheet for AI assistants and buying agents (linked from llms.txt, served
# text/plain via vercel.json). It restates only already-published figures and
# explicitly fences the consultation-quoted services under "do not infer or
# estimate one" — that fence is what stops an assistant inventing a number.
!pricing.md

# NOT excluded: a7f3c1e94b2d48f6ae05d7c318b6f240.txt — the IndexNow key file is
# a public ownership token, not a secret. IndexNow requires it to be fetchable
# at the site root; excluding it breaks every Bing/Yandex ping.
